    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "29b0a2ff23b9334b40652062616932b5972acde68d2c483f1e18f3cf62ac7fdc",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n一屉铺着十张油纸。\n看看空着的油纸。\n还差几个凑成十？\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
